This repository and the packages built from it contain no hackathon
materials: no hackathon dataset, notebook, deck or ground-truth columns.
The synthetic sample in data/sample/ is generated by truelift itself.
scripts/guard_public.py and the CI workflow enforce this (design D13).

Third-party software that truelift depends on at run time keeps its own
licence. Notices required by Apache-2.0 dependencies (for example
doubleml-pipeline) are reproduced here when a release bundles them.
